# Wave T50 (Fenland kit): bogeyes — the MUDGILL's eyes and dorsal fin at water level in Fenland's south pool: two pale eyes with dark pupils and a low fin ridge breaking a moss-bog pool, ripples at the waterline. The GREAT MIRE sign's own words — 'things with eyes at water level' — and ODO's tenancy ('MUDGILL own the south pools and sublet to the BOGNEWT'), realized as dressing per the Backstory Sync Audit row ('design = tale + sign'); no actor, no dialogue, no event invented. Fully opaque: the pool is baked in at the MEASURED marshbog colours (#6c8358 moss-bog, #526a7b water, #7c9469 highlight). (WAVE-T50-FENLAND-PLAN.md §5.)
